1 second per test
O_DIRECT supported on this platform for open_datasync and open_sync.

Compare file sync methods using one 8kB write:
(in "wal_sync_method" preference order, except fdatasync is Linux's default)
        open_datasync                       229.756 ops/sec    4352 usecs/op
        fdatasync                           556.317 ops/sec    1798 usecs/op
        fsync                               161.107 ops/sec    6207 usecs/op
        fsync_writethrough                              n/a
        open_sync                           162.686 ops/sec    6147 usecs/op

Compare file sync methods using two 8kB writes:
(in "wal_sync_method" preference order, except fdatasync is Linux's default)
        open_datasync                       102.616 ops/sec    9745 usecs/op
        fdatasync                           560.923 ops/sec    1783 usecs/op
        fsync                               162.975 ops/sec    6136 usecs/op
        fsync_writethrough                              n/a
        open_sync                            79.579 ops/sec   12566 usecs/op

Compare open_sync with different write sizes:
(This is designed to compare the cost of writing 16kB in different write
open_sync sizes.)
         1 * 16kB open_sync write           162.760 ops/sec    6144 usecs/op
         2 *  8kB open_sync writes           81.946 ops/sec   12203 usecs/op
